  "title": "Google Ads注册投流教程【中文界面】",
  "author": "良辰美",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "广告投放",
    "广告",
    "Google Ads"
  ],
  "content": "<div>首先，你需要一个google账户，可以自行购买或者注册：</div>\n<div>美国手机号注册：淘宝搜索ultra mobile，\n接码平台\n中国手机号注册，有时候会抽风，要用好点的科学上网</div>\n<div>有了gmail邮箱后就先登陆一下谷歌账户，google ads是全家桶的产品也自动登陆了</div>\n<div>第一步，打开谷歌，搜索 google ads，或者直接点击这个链接：<a href=\"https://ads.google.com/home/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ads.google.com/home/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>点击Start Now, 进入设置两步验证，输入密码</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>第二步，创建广告系列，或者点击重新启用：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img7.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img8.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>我这里选择的是网站</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img9.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img10.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这里我选择的是第一个搜索\n有时候网页加载稍微慢一点，要多等一下，如果没出来，那就再刷新重试</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img11.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img12.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>下一步，一直点击继续，可以都选择默认，我们的目的只是为了快速开启GOOGLE ADS，拿到查看数据的权限，如果你真的要投广告，可以熟悉流程和后台后再仔细对比研究</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img13.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>我正准备修改一下金额调低一下，但是突然跳出来了个身份认证：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img14.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img15.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原来是填写二步验证码就可以了，我这里填完后老是没加载出来，刷新换节点弄了好几次：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img16.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img17.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>点击完下一步会自动检查错误，之后就可以发布了</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img18.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>第三步，提供付款信息</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img19.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>发布完成后，显示\n您的账号无法展示广告要开始投放广告，请输入结算信息。</div>\n<div>点击解决问题：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img20.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>下面会有个人身份姓名和地址，就填写国内实际的就好，r然后是信用卡信息</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img21.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>注意这里的手机号验证跟信用卡要一致，不然收不到，我换了好几个手机号弄了好几次都没收到</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img22.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6h3jwb6xv3_img23.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>最后就是等待付款信息和新建的广告组的审核了。</div>",
  "publishDate": "2024-11-28 20:23",
